Object.assign(window.LF_I18N_EN,{"SOP 流程":"SOPs","SOP 范围":"SOP scope","本项目":"This project","团队共享":"Team shared","内置":"Built-in","内置 SOP":"Built-in SOP","是可复用的 AI 协作流程，由 Agent、脚本和人工审批节点组成：输入一条需求，按步骤产出文档、代码或 PR。":" is a reusable AI workflow made of Agent, script and human-approval steps: give it a requirement and it produces documents, code or a PR step by step.","「本项目」的 SOP 只在当前项目里用；共享后，其他项目可以在「团队共享」里选用；「内置」SOP 由平台提供，复制到本项目后即可运行和修改。":"SOPs under “This project” are only used here. Once shared, other projects can pick them under “Team shared”. “Built-in” SOPs come with the platform; copy one into this project to run and edit it.","内置 SOP 暂时不可用。它们由平台维护、与项目无关，所有项目都能复制使用。":"Built-in SOPs are unavailable right now. They are maintained by the platform and any project can copy them.","还没有共享给当前项目的 SOP。把本项目的 SOP 设为共享后，其他项目会在这里看到。":"No SOPs are shared with this project yet. Share an SOP from its project and others will see it here.","当前项目还没有 SOP。可以新建，或从「团队共享」/「内置」复制一份。":"This project has no SOPs yet. Create one, or copy one from “Team shared” or “Built-in”.","去「SOP 流程」新建或复制一条":"Create or copy one in “SOPs”","查看 SOP 流程 ↗":"View SOPs ↗","前往 SOP 流程 · 内置":"Go to SOPs · Built-in","可复用的 AI 协作流程":"Reusable AI workflows","打开 SOP 流程，切到「":"Open SOPs, switch to the “","」标签，选「":"” tab, pick “","」→「复制到本项目」。":"” → “Copy to this project”.","内置 SOP 是平台维护的只读蓝图，复制后才能派发和修改。":"Built-in SOPs are read-only blueprints maintained by the platform; copy one to dispatch and edit it.","运行条件":"Requirements to run","无需 Key 或仓库":"No key or repository needed","只包含脚本和人工审批节点":"Only script and human-approval steps","需要 ":"Needs ","GitHub 仓库":"GitHub repository","Agent 节点调用模型，需要在个人设置里配置 CodeBuddy API Key。":"Agent steps call a model, so set a CodeBuddy API key in Settings.","需要为项目绑定默认 GitHub 仓库，并在个人设置里配置 GitHub Token。":"Bind a default GitHub repository to the project and set a GitHub token in Settings.","平台连不上 Docker，这个 SOP 现在跑不了。重新运行 scripts/install.sh 会自动安装并挂载 Docker。":"The platform cannot reach Docker, so this SOP cannot run yet. Re-run scripts/install.sh to install and mount Docker.","在隔离的 Docker 沙箱里运行，首次运行会构建镜像，需要几分钟。":"Runs in an isolated Docker sandbox; the first run builds the image and takes a few minutes.","去个人设置配置":"Configure in Settings","去配置 GitHub Token":"Set GitHub token","绑定仓库":"Add repository","30 秒看懂 LoopForge":"LoopForge in 30 seconds","① 需求":"① Requirement","在这里描述要做什么，或在需求列表里建一条需求。":"Describe what you need here, or create a requirement in Requirements.","② SOP":"② SOP","可复用的 AI 协作流程：Agent、脚本和人工审批按步骤执行。":"A reusable AI workflow: Agents, scripts and human approvals run step by step.","③ 产物 / PR":"③ Artifacts / PR","文档、代码和 PR 都留档可追溯，关键节点由你确认。":"Documents, code and PRs are kept and traceable; you approve the key steps.","Main Bot 会根据你的需求推荐合适的 SOP。":"Main Bot suggests a suitable SOP for your request.","看一个跑完的例子":"See a finished example","一键在体验项目里跑一条示例 SOP：脚本生成报告 → 你来审批 → 继续执行，无需 API Key。":"Run a sample SOP in the demo project with one click: a script writes a report → you approve → it continues. No API key needed.","一键体验":"Try it now","跑通第一条 SOP":"Run your first SOP","描述需求或提问，Main Bot 会推荐合适的 SOP；用 @ 引用上下文":"Describe a need or ask a question; Main Bot will suggest an SOP. Use @ to reference context","准备一个项目":"Prepare a project","项目用来归集需求、SOP 和运行记录。可以直接用体验项目，也可以新建项目并绑定 GitHub 仓库。":"Projects group requirements, SOPs and runs. Use the demo project, or create one and bind a GitHub repository."});
